# D77orphaned: intentionally empty. Masks /usr/lib/udev/rules.d/64-md-raid-assembly.rules so the
# live system never auto-assembles MD RAID / auto-activates LVM on target
# disks after boot (rd.md=0 / rd.lvm=0 only cover the initramfs).
# Assemble or activate by hand when you mean to:
#   mdadm --assemble --readonly ...
#   vgchange -ay --config 'activation { read_only_volume_list = [ "<vg>" ] }' <vg>
# Not "vgchange --readonly" (it activates nothing) and not "lvchange -pr"
# (it writes the permission into the LVM metadata on the disk).
